  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Discussing and developing mechanisms for better regional dialogue, and exploring and identifiying avenues for regional de-escalation. Convening of dialogues with relevant stakeholders and actors of influence. Through this grant, the recipient will work with leaders and informal leaders to undertake economic and political reforms that furthers the role of women through enhanced economic and social integration and cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
